# The heart of the adhesive tape industry network

## Afera, The European Adhesive Tape Association: We are the voice of the pressure-sensitive
## adhesive tape technology value chain, focusing on technical standardisation, regulatory affairs,
## sustainability, networking, educational events, and market data and trends.


## About us

Afera is known and valued as the go-to community of the European tape industry for addressing key
current and future topics that individual stakeholders cannot tackle alone.

### Latest news

[

#### The Tape College bridges knowledge gaps across the tape value chain

15 July 2026 Adhesive tape performance depends on a chain of interlocking decisions. At ETW 2026,
Afera’s 12th Tape College shows how those decisions connect across materials, production,
converting, testing and use.
][140] [

#### Afera advances next-level test methods work

15 July 2026 The TM-WG is refining Afera 5001, preparing a new method for film surface treatment,
and strengthening the Association’s contribution to European and international standardisation.
][141] [

#### Dalpo expands European tape footprint with Premier Limpet acquisition

15 July 2026 The acquisition gives Afera Member Dalpo Poland sp. z o.o. an established U.K.
manufacturing and distribution base in printed and plain adhesive tapes.
][142]
