## Collaboration drives sustainability innovation in adhesive tapes industry: Carboledger podcast
## serves as masterclass

Discover how collaboration is transforming sustainability in the adhesive tapes industry through a
"masterclass" podcast on innovative carbon footprint calculation. In an exclusive Carboledger
interview, current Afera President Evert Smit reveals how competitors are joining forces to create a
groundbreaking solution that could revolutionise environmental measurement across manufacturing
sectors.

